00:32:41.820 --> 00:32:43.310
So we formed a small team.

00:32:43.310 --> 00:32:45.190
We kind of looked at what we do.

00:32:45.190 --> 00:32:46.850
We migrated our application.

00:32:46.850 --> 00:32:50.070
This application has been
built over 15 to 20 years

00:32:50.070 --> 00:32:52.490
within Sanmina for
